  'SessionEvent 日志是一次 Agent 交互的唯一真源；模型消息历史、UI 状态和回放结果都从同一序列派生，不存在另一份单独维护的 transcript。每条事件都有连续 seq 和毫秒时间戳，payload 必须是无损 JSON。': 'The SessionEvent log is the single source of truth for an agent interaction. Model history, UI state, and replay results all derive from the same sequence; no separately maintained transcript exists. Every event has a contiguous sequence number and millisecond timestamp, and its payload must be lossless JSON.',
