  '原始 assistant chunks 会完整记录以保证流式回放；组装后的 assistant message 才进入派生历史。完整 request header 记录模型、系统提示词与工具 schema，只有配置变化时再写一份新快照，因此任意请求都能从日志重建。': 'Raw assistant chunks are logged in full for faithful streaming replay; only the assembled assistant message enters derived history. A complete request header records the model, system prompt, and tool schemas, and a new snapshot is written only when configuration changes, making every request reconstructible from the log.',
