  'Workspace 与 Session 列表各有独立的 pending → ready 基线。基线请求进行时到达的新增、更新、移除和顺序帧不会丢失，而是在响应之上重放；重连后的新基线会接纳其他客户端在离线期间提交的持久顺序。': 'Workspace and Session lists have independent pending → ready baselines. Add, update, remove, and ordering frames arriving during a baseline request are replayed over its response instead of being lost; a new post-reconnect baseline accepts durable ordering submitted by other clients while this one was offline.',
  '拖拽先乐观显示': 'Show drag order optimistically',
  'Workspace 拖拽会立即安装本地顺序，再等待 Host 确认。只有最新请求的回声可以结算它，更新的 Host 顺序帧又优先于较旧回声。': 'A workspace drag installs local ordering immediately, then waits for host confirmation. Only the latest request echo may settle it, while a newer host ordering frame takes precedence over an older echo.',
