  '本页依据 DeepSeek Harness 仓库中的中文指南、CLI 参考与插件开发文档整理，最后核对上游提交 ': 'This page is based on the DeepSeek Harness guides, CLI reference, and plugin development documentation, last checked against upstream commit ',
