  '凭据再加一层': 'Credentials add another layer',
  '本地 Credentials 的顺序是继承环境 → 受管 ': 'Local credential precedence is inherited environment → managed ',
  ' → project-env → user-env；受管写入会覆盖旧的两个 ': ' → project-env → user-env. A managed write overrides stale values in both ',
  ' 后备值。': ' fallback layers.',
  '选择工作区不会加载它的 .env': 'Selecting a workspace does not load its .env',
  '项目环境绑定 Harness 的 invocation cwd，而不是随后由 Agent 选择的工作区。否则模型在会话中途切换目录，就可能间接改变宿主配置和凭据来源。': 'The project environment is bound to the Harness invocation cwd, not a workspace later selected by an agent. Otherwise, changing directories mid-session could indirectly alter host configuration and credential sources.',
  'Preset 是包含 ': 'A preset is a directory containing ',
  ' 的目录，决定一个 Agent 可见的工具、提示词和投影插件。Roster 把每个版本的组装常驻挂载一次，各会话通过 scope 父链加入，实现 ': '. It determines the tools, prompts, and projection plugins visible to an agent. The roster mounts each composition generation once, and sessions join through the scope parent chain to resolve ',
  ' 的近层遮蔽。': ' with nearest-layer shadowing.',
  '每次 list/resolve 重新扫描根目录，并把损坏项连同原因一起列出。': 'Every list or resolve rescans roots and reports broken entries with their reasons.',
  '挂载': 'Mount',
  '会话发布前验证组装并加入常驻 scope，失败则回滚整个创建。': 'Validate composition and join its standing scope before session publication; failure rolls back creation.',
  '固定': 'Pin',
  '运行中会话保留原代际；编辑文件只影响随后创建的会话。': 'A running session stays on its generation; file edits affect only subsequently created sessions.',
  '只有空白会话可以切换 Preset，因为已有历史可能包含新工具集无法执行的调用。用户 Preset 的信任等级只是 UI 提示，不提供隔离；它引用的插件拥有什么权限，它就拥有什么权限。': 'Only a blank session may switch presets because existing history may contain calls the new tool set cannot execute. A user preset trust label is UI guidance, not isolation; the preset has the permissions of every plugin it references.',
  'Persona 与系统提示词组装': 'Persona and prompt assembly',
  '系统提示词由具名、带 order 的 section 组成，并在每次模型步骤前与工具 schema、变量和动态 runtime context 一起组装。Scoped section 会遮蔽同名全局 section；重复注册或未解析模板变量会立即失败。': 'The system prompt consists of named, ordered sections assembled with tool schemas, variables, and dynamic runtime context before every model step. A scoped section shadows a same-named global section; duplicate registration or unresolved template variables fail immediately.',
  '固定身份开场，位于最前。': 'Fixed Harness identity at the beginning.',
  '部署级人设，可由 Preset 内 persona 按 scope 替换。': 'Deployment persona, replaceable by a preset-scoped persona.',
  '由工具插件携带的使用策略。': 'Usage policy carried by tool plugins.',
  'Persona 的 ': 'Persona ',
