  '、': ', ',
  ' 及其本地 overlay。越具体的目录优先级越高；同目录内容完全相同的候选文件只注入一次。': ', and their local overlays at each level. More specific directories take precedence, and byte-identical candidates in one directory are injected only once.',
  '建立基线': 'Build the baseline',
  '指令作为带来源的持久 user message 进入第一步，与直接提示词一起抵达首次请求。': 'Instructions enter step one as a sourced durable user message and reach the first request alongside the direct prompt.',
  '发现深层规则': 'Discover deeper rules',
  '成功的第一方 read、write 或 edit 到达新目录后，追加适用于该 scope 的指令。': 'After a successful first-party read, write, or edit reaches a new directory, instructions for that scope are appended.',
  '对账变化': 'Reconcile changes',
  '编辑产生替换消息，删除产生 tombstone；恢复和压缩后依靠持久来源重新收敛。': 'An edit emits a replacement message and deletion emits a tombstone; durable provenance allows recovery and post-compaction convergence.',
  ' 为整个渲染设置硬预算，优先保留最具体的文件：先省略较宽泛来源，再截断最具体来源，并向模型报告省略或截断路径。单文件读取还受 ': ' sets a hard budget for the complete rendering and preserves the most specific files first: broader sources are omitted before the most specific source is truncated, with omitted or truncated paths reported to the model. Each file read is also bounded by ',
  ' 限制。': '.',
  '发现由结构化文件操作驱动': 'Discovery follows structured filesystem operations',
  '插件没有文件 watcher，也不会解析任意 shell 语法；': 'The plugin has no filesystem watcher and does not parse arbitrary shell syntax. A ',
  ' 中的 ': ' command ',
  ' 不会发现嵌套指令。外部改动会在下一次成功的第一方文件操作、会话恢复对账或压缩后重建基线时变得可见。候选文件末段 symlink 会被跟随，因此不受信任仓库仍需文件系统策略或 OS 沙箱约束。': ' does not discover nested instructions. External changes become visible after the next successful first-party filesystem operation, recovery reconciliation, or post-compaction baseline rebuild. A symlink in the final candidate path is followed, so untrusted repositories still require filesystem policy or an OS sandbox.',
  '请求本地的持久时间上下文': 'Durable request-local time context',
