  ' 在模型步骤准备期采样带时区时间、经过时长和当前开放轮次的浏览器时区。官方 Schedule Web overlay 会挂载它；默认组合不会自动启用。': ' samples zoned time, elapsed time, and the browser time zone of the current open turn while preparing a model step. The official Schedule Web overlay mounts it; default compositions do not enable it automatically.',
  '唯一时区': 'One time zone',
